There are three important properties involved in this:  
Your alignment, your alignment score and your god's 
anger.  Killing pets will lower your alignment score 
considerably; praying under wrong circumstances will 
anger your god.  However, no matter how bad your 
alignment score and your god's anger will be, there 
is always hope that you can mollify him.  (Unless you 
leave the dungeon in celestial disgrace, at least.)  
The way to break relations with your god while in the 
dungeon is to convert to a new alignment.  

